        {
          "book": "EZK",
          "chapter": 34,
          "verse": 5
        }
      ],
      "en": "They were scattered, because there was no shepherd. They became food to all the animals of the field, and were scattered.",
      "ko": "목자가 없으므로 그것들이 흩어지며 흩어져서 모든 들짐승의 밥이 되었도다",
      "source_text_hash": "bddcaa9337a330bcafc27bd5b68d4da3493bd618611df6fea46189c7bdd1d584",
      "translation_text_hash": "cf50ae051d812079ec00ffd068f7dbc0d45e96d417d3e7190bf82ae780a68126",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "목자가 없으므로 그것들이 흩어지며 흩어져서 모든 들짐승의 밥이 되었도다"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "cf50ae051d812079ec00ffd068f7dbc0d45e96d417d3e7190bf82ae780a68126"
      ]
    },
    {
      "canonical_locator": "bible:web:EZK:34:6",
      "sequence": 21320,
      "chapter_label": "EZK 34",
      "verse_label": "6",
      "locator": {
        "book": "EZK",
